= Palmiro Togliatti

Togliatti is a member of the <span style=" color:#8B0000">Communist</span> faction of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span>, one of the few pro-interventionists, as well as aligning and closely collaborating with Antonio Gramsci.

