@togliatti_coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Togliatti can improve our relationships with our centrist and centre-left coalition partners in the Chamber of Deputies.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (centre_left_coalition or socialist_catholic_coalition or left_wing_coalition)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not centre_left_coalition and not left_wing_coalition and not socialist_catholic_coalition : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> is not currently in a coalition. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1; ldr_relation += 7 if centre_left_coalition; ds_relation += 5 if centre_left_coalition; psri_relation += 9; ppi_relation += 7 if socialist_catholic_coalition;

We have improved our relations with our coalition partners and reduced tensions with the coalition.

@public_education
title: Public Education
subtitle: As we control the Public Education Ministry, we are able to direct policy, potentially benefitting us.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and psi_in_government and public_education_minister_party == psi_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psi_in_government : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> is not currently in government. ?][? if not public_education_minister_party == psi_name : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> is not in control of the Public Education Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: education_policy

